{"c":[{"id":"2464ad6d4d98dee3","sum":"Session markdown-it disables CommonMark escapes (bindSessionMarkdown) so \\.cursor paths render; dashboard subagent pills omit unmatched Claude spawn ids, JSON export keeps messages[].subagents and parent_spawn, and leftover is Cursor-only (needs parent message ordinals).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T135929Z-b16be49ee4a5a309","text":"Session-body markdown-it disables CommonMark escape via bindSessionMarkdown so \\.cursor and other hidden-dot paths survive render.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T140109Z-ffeba3eb9433dbab","text":"Dashboard subagent pills: Claude unmatched spawn ids omitted (no leftover); JSON export keeps messages[].subagents and parent_spawn; leftover is Cursor-only and needs parent message ordinals.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b5e01e46143d148c","sum":"Dashboard session view shows corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) and a parent: line, never guessing a turn: Claude joins spawn ids; Cursor places only an aligned zip (count + agent_type==subagent_type) or a unique agent_type; holes/extras omitted; unknown harness: none.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T154745Z-a99acf23a825f6a2","text":"Dashboard subagent pills: never guess a turn. Cursor leftover gone. Place only aligned zip (count + agent_type==subagent_type) or unique agent_type. Omit holes/extras. Unknown harness empty.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T161338Z-78459a311c0536ae","text":"Dashboard session view now shows corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) and a parent: line; Claude joins spawn ids, Cursor places only aligned or unique agent_type pairs, unknown harness omits.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
